# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# The defaults of the Python model are those of the control file
# (D[python-defaults], #281): the dipeptide in water given to both front
# ends on a GPU with nothing beyond the files, the ensemble, the periodic
# boundary, and the deterministic mode. The energies of step 0 are those
# of the row of `mdir run`, and after 20 steps the positions, the
# velocities, the forces, and the cell are those of its checkpoint to the
# bit, with its fingerprint, at constant energy, temperature, and
# pressure, in double and in mixed precision.
# Inputs/python_defaults.py.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_defaults.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU Double mdir %t/Double run | FileCheck %s -DL="GPU Double"
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_defaults.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU Mixed mdir %t/Mixed run | FileCheck %s -DL="GPU Mixed"
# CHECK: [[L]] NVE: the energies of step 0 within {{[0-9.e-]+}} kcal/mol of the row of mdir run, and 20 steps to its bits, with its fingerprint
# CHECK: [[L]] NVT: the energies of step 0 within {{[0-9.e-]+}} kcal/mol of the row of mdir run, and 20 steps to its bits, with its fingerprint
# CHECK: [[L]] NPT: the energies of step 0 within {{[0-9.e-]+}} kcal/mol of the row of mdir run, and 20 steps to its bits, with its fingerprint
# CHECK: defaults run [[L]] passed
